2 decode image with axi sram at

#define JPEG\_WORKSPACE\_BASE 0x24040000 // AXI SRAM (fast)

#define JPEG\_WORKSPACE\_SIZE (256 \* 1024) // 512KB (up from 256KB)

3 copy buffer to external sdram

4 dma2d copy and display image .

